  <!-- STORY -->
  <section class="block" id="story">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head center" style="margin-bottom:24px">
        <p class="kicker">Our Story</p>
      </div>
      <p class="story-state" data-reveal>A small family-owned cafe in Torrance — <em>generous bowls, handheld onigirazu,</em> and people who are glad you came.</p>
      <p class="story-copy" data-reveal>Sodam brings together the family's favorites: Hawaiian-style poke over warm sushi rice and spring mix, <strong>Okinawa-style onigiri</strong> wrapped with spam and egg, and <strong>onigirazu</strong>, the rice sandwiches you can eat with one hand. Nothing here is skimpy — bowls come piled with avocado, seaweed salad, imitation crab, cucumber, and furikake, and every order is built one guest at a time.</p>
      <div class="story-photos" data-reveal-group>
        <figure data-reveal>
          <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Inside Sodam's cozy Torrance cafe — the ordering counter with Okinawa-style onigiri posters, matcha sign, and drinks menus" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption>Inside our little shop on Hawthorne Blvd</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure data-reveal>
          <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Sodam bowl with seasoned beef, rice, cucumber, tomatoes, corn, and greens" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption>Fresh from the bowl bar</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure data-reveal>
          <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Sodam Cafe storefront in Torrance with its green SODAM CAFE sign, boba window lettering, and menu posters in the window" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption>Our storefront — come say hello</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <div class="values" data-reveal-group>
        <div class="value" data-reveal><h3>Family Owned</h3><p>A neighborhood cafe run by family, with care in every order.</p></div>
        <div class="value" data-reveal><h3>Generous Portions</h3><p>Bowls and rice sandwiches built to actually fill you up.</p></div>
        <div class="value" data-reveal><h3>Made to Order</h3><p>Fresh fish, warm rice, and drinks mixed when you order.</p></div>
      </div>
      <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:36px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:19px">Follow along on Instagram — <a href="https://www.instagram.com/sodamcafe_/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>@sodamcafe_</strong></a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ORDER CONFIRMATION -->
