  <!-- STAFF ORDERS BOARD — staff sign-in required, customers never see orders -->
  <section class="block staff-sec" id="staff">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <p class="kicker">For the Cafe Team Only</p>
        <h2>Staff Orders Board</h2>
        <p>This board is <strong>for staff only</strong> and stays locked until a staff member signs in with the shared staff password. Customers never see this board or its orders — they only see their own order status after they place an order.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="staff-locked" id="staffLocked">
        <span class="lock-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="10" width="16" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Staff only — sign in to view orders</h3>
        <p>Tap below and enter the shared staff password to unlock the board. This is the <strong>staff</strong> sign-in — it is different from the Regulars sign-in, where customers use just their name &amp; phone with no password.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:18px"><button type="button" class="signin-btn" id="staffLockedBtn">Staff Sign-In</button></p>
      </div>
      <div id="staffBoardWrap" hidden>
      <p style="color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:16px;margin:0 0 6px">Pickup orders placed on this page appear here as <strong>New</strong>. Leave this page open in the cafe — a banner and a chime announce each new order. Move each order along as you work: New &rarr; Preparing &rarr; Ready &rarr; Picked up. Totals are paid by the customer at pickup. The customer&rsquo;s own tracker updates as you move their order.</p>
      <div class="new-alert" id="staffAlert" role="alert">
        <strong id="staffAlertTitle">New order received!</strong>
        <span id="staffAlertText"></span>
        <button type="button" id="staffAlertView">View New Orders</button>
        <button type="button" id="staffAlertDismiss" style="background:transparent;color:#FFF7EA;border:1.5px solid #FFF7EA">Dismiss</button>
      </div>
      <div class="staff-tools">
        <span class="counts" id="staffCounts">0 new · 0 preparing · 0 ready</span>
        <button type="button" class="pill-btn" id="soundToggle" aria-pressed="true">Alert Sound: On</button>
        <button type="button" class="pill-btn" id="soundTest">Test Chime</button>
        <button type="button" class="pill-btn staff-signout-btn" id="staffSignOut">Staff Sign Out — Lock Board</button>
      </div>
      <div class="staff-tools" role="tablist" aria-label="Filter orders by status" id="staffFilters">
        <button type="button" class="pill-btn" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-sfilter="active">Active</button>
        <button type="button" class="pill-btn" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-sfilter="new">New</button>
        <button type="button" class="pill-btn" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-sfilter="preparing">Preparing</button>
        <button type="button" class="pill-btn" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-sfilter="ready">Ready</button>
        <button type="button" class="pill-btn" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-sfilter="picked_up">Picked Up</button>
        <button type="button" class="pill-btn" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-sfilter="all">All</button>
      </div>
      <div id="staffBoard"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<div class="global-alert" id="globalAlert" role="alert">
  <strong>🔔 New pickup order!</strong><span id="globalAlertText"></span>
  <button type="button" id="globalAlertView">View on Staff Board</button>
  <button type="button" id="globalAlertDismiss" style="background:transparent;color:#FFF7EA;border:1.5px solid #FFF7EA">Dismiss</button>
</div>
<div class="added-toast" id="addedToast" role="status">Added to your order ✓</div>
<div class="float-cart" id="floatCart"><button type="button" id="floatCartBtn"><span id="floatCartLabel">View order</span><span id="floatCartTotal"></span></button></div>
<div class="qscroll" id="qscroll" role="scrollbar" tabindex="0" aria-label="Quick scroll — drag or tap to move up or down the page" aria-orientation="vertical" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0" hidden>
  <div class="qscroll-track"></div>
